  "changelog": "mao-colleague 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release of the \u6bdb\u6cfd\u4e1c\u65b9\u6cd5\u8bbaAI\u52a9\u624b skill.\n- Provides intelligent analysis and recommendations based on Mao Zedong\u2019s methodological system and expression style.\n- Implements a modern six-layer cognitive architecture for stability and scalability.\n- Features smart method recommendation, four-level progressive learning paths, and a searchable network of 674 core concepts.\n- Offers backward compatibility for all legacy commands.",
